# ─── Build artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The web UI build output is ignored, except the Phase 1 placeholder index.html,
# which must be tracked so //go:embed in package web has a file to embed in a
# fresh checkout / CI build. The full front-end build overwrites it later.
/web/dist/*
!/web/dist/index.html
/web/.vite/

# goreleaser
/dist/

